            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat initializer untuk class <code>Song</code> yang menerima <code>name</code> dan <code>artist</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Song\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", artist: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".artist = artist\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>init</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>name</code>, <code>artist</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>.</p></body></html>"
